OL,3,GNEWSA'Millionaire' gang boss called
OL,4,Apolice on drug phone
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cocaine dealer who was living an
OL,7,F"extravagant" and "millionaire's"
OL,8,Flifestyle was caught after he used his
OL,9,Fdrug operation phone to report a
OL,10,Fburglary to police, a court has heard.
OL,12,FAndrew Savage, 34, was estimated to
OL,13,Fhave sold more than #1m worth of drugs
OL,14,Fover a six year period and spent money
OL,15,Fon luxury holidays, clothes and gold,
OL,16,FTeesside Crown Court heard.
OL,18,FA judge said Savage's drugs spread
OL,19,F"misery" and devastated lives.
